      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, each of the Systems has a Board of Trustees (\"Board\") to fulfill its investment and administrative functions, including making disability pension determinations, and those Trustees have a fiduciary responsibility to ensure that all disability determinations and administrative decisions are made in the best interests of the respective System or the Plan; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
